.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="van_deemter_H evaluates H=A+B/u+Cu, the sum of eddy diffusion (`A`), longitudinal diffusion (`B/u`, dominant at low flow) and mass-transfer resistance (`Cu`, dominant at high flow). The competition between the last two gives a minimum plate height H_{min}=A+2\sqrt{BC} at u_{opt}=\sqrt{B/C} (~chemistrykit.analytical.minimum_plate_height, optimum_flow_velocity).">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/analytical/chromatography/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_03_van_deemter_equation_thumb.png
