.. only:: not html

 * :doc:`/api/gallery/analytical/chromatography/plot_03_van_deemter_equation`

.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="An open capillary has no packing, so Golay&#x27;s equation for it is the van Deemter equation with no eddy-diffusion term: H=B/u+Cu. Using van_deemter_H with A=0 for a capillary and A&gt;0 for a packed column shows the lower plate height, and hence the many more plates a long capillary delivers.">

